{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8246374",
      "title": "Creating & Providing The Context",
      "sourceHash": "34c42cc330fe91dd15b159a66e6cd943f616c6b9615ccd49421b40e7c2fcb01b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 3.12,
          "en": "So let's add some context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.12,
          "end": 7.17,
          "en": "to this demo app here, to this demo shop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.17,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "And for that I'll start by adding a new folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 14.193,
          "en": "in my src folder and I'll name that folder store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 17.203,
          "en": "Now this is not required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.203,
          "end": 20.13,
          "en": "this is not a technical requirement,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.13,
          "end": 21.72,
          "en": "this is just a convention",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.72,
          "end": 25.32,
          "en": "which you'll see in many React apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 30.18,
          "en": "that those context values are stored in files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.18,
          "end": 33.39,
          "en": "that are stored in a folder called store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.39,
          "end": 36.48,
          "en": "because it's your data and state store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.48,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "for the entire application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.61,
          "end": 42.03,
          "en": "or for multiple components at least.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.03,
          "end": 43.77,
          "en": "That's the idea behind this name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.77,
          "end": 47.163,
          "en": "but the name is up to you, it's not set in stone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.54,
          "end": 52.35,
          "en": "Now in that store folder, I'll create a new file now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.35,
          "end": 57.343,
          "en": "and I'll name that file shopping-cart-context.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.8,
          "end": 62.973,
          "en": "Though of course this file name also is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.84,
          "end": 68.34,
          "en": "You could also just name it shopping-cart without -context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.34,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "or anything you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 72.99,
          "en": "But here I'll name it -context to make it very clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.99,
          "end": 77.523,
          "en": "that in this file I'll be managing some React context value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 83.43,
          "en": "Now you can now create such a context value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.43,
          "end": 87.033,
          "en": "by importing a function from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.93,
          "end": 90.09,
          "en": "And that function that must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 90.09,
          "end": 91.713,
          "en": "is called createContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.56,
          "end": 97.86,
          "en": "As a next step, you then call this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 97.86,
          "end": 101.913,
          "en": "and it will then create such a context value for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 106.035,
          "en": "and you can then store that value in any variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.035,
          "end": 108.50999999999999,
          "en": "or constant of your choice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 108.50999999999999,
          "end": 111.243,
          "en": "for example, a constant called CartContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 113.34,
          "end": 115.14,
          "en": "Now the name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 115.14,
          "end": 118.97999999999999,
          "en": "but I'm deliberately starting with an uppercase character,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 118.97999999999999,
          "end": 121.17,
          "en": "an uppercase C here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 121.17,
          "end": 124.95,
          "en": "because this value that is produced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.95,
          "end": 129.95,
          "en": "by createContext will actually be an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 134.013,
          "en": "that contains a React component which we'll need later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 135.09,
          "end": 138.57,
          "en": "So I'll store this context in this constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 138.57,
          "end": 141.989,
          "en": "And as a next step, you can also pass a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 141.989,
          "end": 146.989,
          "en": "to createContext that will be used as an initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 147.39,
          "end": 150.84,
          "en": "that can be provided to multiple components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 150.84,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "in your React app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 156.36,
          "en": "to all the components that will be wrapped by this context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 156.36,
          "end": 160.11,
          "en": "And I'll show you how to wrap this context around components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 160.11,
          "end": 163.143,
          "en": "and how to provide it to those components soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 164.57999999999998,
          "end": 168.12,
          "en": "Now, the value that will be provided to components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 168.12,
          "end": 172.44,
          "en": "via this context feature can be any value you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 172.44,
          "end": 175.41,
          "en": "It can be a number, it can be a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 175.41,
          "end": 179.4,
          "en": "and it can also be an object or array of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 179.4,
          "end": 182.25,
          "en": "And here I'll go for an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 186.3,
          "en": "and I'll go for an object that has a items property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 186.3,
          "end": 189.66,
          "en": "which initially will be an empty array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 189.66,
          "end": 192.963,
          "en": "and that will later store my shopping cart items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 194.07,
          "end": 197.01,
          "en": "So that's the first thing I'll add here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 197.01,
          "end": 200.91,
          "en": "And I'm using an object that contains this property instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 200.91,
          "end": 204.69,
          "en": "of just passing an array as a value, which we could also do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 204.69,
          "end": 208.143,
          "en": "because I will soon add more to this context object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 209.67000000000002,
          "end": 211.98,
          "en": "But with that we got the context set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 211.98,
          "end": 216.6,
          "en": "The next step now is to provide it to this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 216.6,
          "end": 218.103,
          "en": "and to our components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 219.54,
          "end": 223.784,
          "en": "We need to provide this context to our application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 223.784,
          "end": 227.94,
          "en": "and we need to wrap it around parts of that application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 227.94,
          "end": 231.06,
          "en": "parts of our component tree, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 231.06,
          "end": 233.57999999999998,
          "en": "so that those wrapped components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 233.57999999999998,
          "end": 237.903,
          "en": "can access this value which we're providing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 239.43,
          "end": 243.21,
          "en": "And you do provide your context by first of all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 246.96,
          "en": "exporting it so that we can use it outside of this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 246.96,
          "end": 249.513,
          "en": "because we need to use it outside of this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 251.01,
          "end": 255.78,
          "en": "And then as a next step, you should go to a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 255.78,
          "end": 258.48,
          "en": "that contains all the other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 258.48,
          "end": 261.39300000000003,
          "en": "that will need to use this context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 262.47,
          "end": 265.113,
          "en": "For example here, our app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 266.07,
          "end": 269.31,
          "en": "There we got all these components here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 269.31,
          "end": 272.67,
          "en": "the header and the shop, and the product component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 272.67,
          "end": 273.9,
          "en": "And it's for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 273.9,
          "end": 275.25,
          "en": "the product component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 275.25,
          "end": 278.79,
          "en": "that will later need to change the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 278.79,
          "end": 280.92,
          "en": "that's stored in our context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 280.92,
          "end": 283.743,
          "en": "because it needs to update that items array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 284.61,
          "end": 288.84000000000003,
          "en": "And it's some nested component in the header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 288.84000000000003,
          "end": 291.63,
          "en": "to be precise, it's the CartComponent there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 291.63,
          "end": 294.9,
          "en": "that will need to read the items to output them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 294.9,
          "end": 297.363,
          "en": "and it then also needs to update them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 298.5,
          "end": 301.56,
          "en": "So therefore the app component is a great place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 301.56,
          "end": 304.98,
          "en": "to wrap header and shop with our context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 304.98,
          "end": 309.18,
          "en": "so that those components or their child components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 309.18,
          "end": 310.923,
          "en": "can use that context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 312.21,
          "end": 317.21,
          "en": "And therefore I'll start by importing this CartContext,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 317.31,
          "end": 322.31,
          "en": "which we just created from this store folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 322.47,
          "end": 325.743,
          "en": "and there the shopping-cart-context.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 328.68,
          "end": 331.59,
          "en": "So now with that imported here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 331.59,
          "end": 336.15,
          "en": "we can use that as a wrapper around header and shop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 336.15,
          "end": 337.98,
          "en": "And that's why I chose a name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 337.98,
          "end": 340.14,
          "en": "that starts with an uppercase character",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 340.14,
          "end": 343.863,
          "en": "because we're now going to use this context as a component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 344.79,
          "end": 347.19,
          "en": "We'll wrap it around the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 347.19,
          "end": 350.883,
          "en": "that should be able to access this context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 352.17,
          "end": 355.71,
          "en": "Now it's worth noting here that using the context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 355.71,
          "end": 357.69,
          "en": "as a component like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 357.69,
          "end": 362.55,
          "en": "will work if you are using React 19 or higher,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 362.55,
          "end": 366.783,
          "en": "but will not work with older versions of React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 367.62,
          "end": 371.76,
          "en": "Instead there when using older versions of React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 371.76,
          "end": 376.76,
          "en": "you would have to access a nested provider property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 377.1,
          "end": 379.743,
          "en": "on that CartContext object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 380.76,
          "end": 384.48,
          "en": "And this also still works with React 19 by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 384.48,
          "end": 389.48,
          "en": "So you can use this approach even if you are using React 19,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 389.49,
          "end": 392.94,
          "en": "but you need to use it if you're using an older version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 392.94,
          "end": 396.09000000000003,
          "en": "And that's why I will use this notation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 396.09000000000003,
          "end": 398.25,
          "en": "this code here in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 398.25,
          "end": 400.05,
          "en": "so that you can follow along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 400.05,
          "end": 401.94,
          "en": "and get something out of the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 401.94,
          "end": 404.28,
          "en": "no matter on which kind of projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 404.28,
          "end": 407.913,
          "en": "and with which React versions you might work in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 409.38,
          "end": 411.81,
          "en": "Now, this of course is a notation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 411.81,
          "end": 414.03,
          "en": "that you might have never seen before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 414.03,
          "end": 417.813,
          "en": "having a component name that contains a . like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 418.8,
          "end": 420.81,
          "en": "But in the end, what we're doing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 420.81,
          "end": 425.34,
          "en": "is we're simply accessing a nested property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 425.34,
          "end": 427.32,
          "en": "on the CartContext object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 427.32,
          "end": 432.32,
          "en": "And that property turns out to hold a React component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 432.36,
          "end": 434.55,
          "en": "and therefore this overall code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 434.55,
          "end": 438.12,
          "en": "can be used like a React component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 438.12,
          "end": 441,
          "en": "So it's not just components like header or shop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 441,
          "end": 445.53,
          "en": "that can be used like components as JSX elements like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 445.53,
          "end": 447.99,
          "en": "but it's also nested components like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 447.99,
          "end": 450.18,
          "en": "that can be used in JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 450.18,
          "end": 452.343,
          "en": "That's just something to keep in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 453.39,
          "end": 457.26,
          "en": "So I'll use CartContext.Provider here as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 457.26,
          "end": 459.033,
          "en": "around header and shop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 460.32,
          "end": 464.01,
          "en": "And it's worth noting of course that this provider property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 464.01,
          "end": 466.62,
          "en": "is not a property created by us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 466.62,
          "end": 471.62,
          "en": "Instead, my context value here just has a items property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 471.9,
          "end": 473.28,
          "en": "but there is a difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 473.28,
          "end": 476.103,
          "en": "between the object that's created by createContext,",
